# Tasks that CPAchecker reported ASSERTION on for property unreach-call when the
# counterexample check uses the internal automaton (ARGUtils.producePathAutomaton)
# instead of a witness
# (from cex-format-comparison-with-overflow results.2026-09-03_09-45-08.table.csv,
# run sets integration-nightly-value.automaton and .automaton-fix).
#
# All 48 tasks fail in both automaton run sets and in neither of the witness-based
# run sets (.baseline = GraphML, .yaml-witness = witness v2), because only the
# internal automaton writes the unfiltered concrete-value dump of the counterexample,
# which can contain a dereferenced function pointer used as a value.
# Used to verify the function-pointer fix in AddressHandler.getOptionalValueFormula.

